OL,5,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FOver a Bank Holiday, near
OL,7,     FScarborough, a high-speed pursuit
OL,8,     Fensues after a driver fails to
OL,9,     Fstop. In the Dales, an operation
OL,10,     Fis underway to crack down on
OL,11,     Fmotorists flouting the law.
OL,12,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FWith North Yorkshire's roads a big
OL,14,     Fdraw for bikers, policing them is
OL,15,     Fa top priority. A 70-year-old
OL,16,     Fbiker crashes down an embankment
OL,17,     Fbut is spared serious injury
OL,18,     Fthanks to a gadget.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/8
