OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FThe nation's favourite GP surgery
OL,7,     Fis back. Damian has an unsightly
OL,8,     Flump on his eye, worried mum
OL,9,     FLorena fears daughter Emma has
OL,10,     Fsleep apnoea and Peter is
OL,11,     Fstruggling with unbearable pain.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FThe team continues to work
OL,14,     Ftogether to help the ill and
OL,15,     Finjured of South Yorkshire, aiding
OL,16,     Fpatients suffer-ing from heart
OL,17,     Fattacks, road traffic collisions
OL,18,     Fand allergic reactions.
