OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FMedics rush to a 60-year-old woman
OL,7,     Fwith suspected multiple injuries,
OL,8,     Ftrapped in her car, and to a
OL,9,     F36-year-old knife attack victim,
OL,10,     Fwho has extensive injuries to his
OL,11,     Fneck and face.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FAfter a terrible accident on his
OL,14,     Fbike, a man has an excruciating
OL,15,     Ftear on his chin. A man is rushed
OL,16,     Fin, escorted by police with a
OL,17,     Fsuspected overdose. A cyclist has
OL,18,     Fbeen hit by a car.
