OL,5,G0100 Murdered at First Sight
OL,6,     FIn 2021, Sean McKay is stabbed in
OL,7,     FStevenston, Scotland, by Gary
OL,8,     FMcVey. Despite help from
OL,9,     Fbystanders, he dies. McVey shows
OL,10,     Fno remorse, later bragging about
OL,11,     Fthe murder.
OL,12,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FAs a heatwave hits Barnsley,
OL,14,     Fpressure increases for sister Jane
OL,15,     Fin casualty. Among those seeking
OL,16,     Femergency treatment are
OL,17,     F65-year-old Theresa, with a
OL,18,     Fpossible stroke.
